title: 'Gnomon boards: FigJam-style shared canvases, repo-committed like lore, extensible by mods'
summary: 'Founder extended the canvas vision: boards raised like artifacts where the founder and agents draw, write, and place images, diagrams and webpages to explore ideas together; saved, shared, and later committed to repos (like lore) so teammates open them; board mods let developers add node types, tools and live widgets on top. Existing groundwork: Gnomon spec OPEN 12 and probe P12 (Excalidraw under the GUI CSP), whose WKWebView failure (T-2026-11-06-003) now matters for boards. Team analysis launched: Arky (architecture), Aegis (threat model), Luna (design), Loid/Jinx/Helix (learning loop, devil''s advocate, DX).'
